{"title":"Snakeskin Knick","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Small Copperhead, Copperhead, Large Copperhead, Coral Snake, Rustscale</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"small-copperhead\" title=\"Small Copperhead - Normal, 22.8% of recorded drops (95 / 416 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/79167631ab2fcb600a3d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Small Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">22.8%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"copperhead-medium\" title=\"Copperhead - Normal, 22.8% of recorded drops (82 / 360 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b134e63b0f937131e7db.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">22.8%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"copperhead-large\" title=\"Large Copperhead - Normal, 24.1% of recorded drops (20 / 83 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/741316ca8960070d6a5b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Large Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">24.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"coral-snake-medium\" title=\"Coral Snake - Normal, 18.8% of recorded drops (6 / 32 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d37b212af105279dd66e.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Coral Snake</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">18.8%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rustscale\" title=\"Rustscale - Normal, 4.3% of recorded drops (1 / 23 events)\"><img